  "notes": "Stages follow UDISE+ (Primary 1–5, Upper Primary 6–8, Secondary 9–10, Higher Secondary 11–12; primary age 6–10). NEP 2020 regroups schooling as 5+3+3+4: Foundational (3 pre-school years + Classes 1–2), Preparatory (3–5), Middle (6–8), Secondary (9–12). CBSE, CISCE and state boards all number Classes 1–12; some states say Standard (Std), Karnataka calls 11–12 PUC, Kerala Plus One/Two, Andhra Pradesh and Telangana Intermediate."
